<title>SINGAPORE: UIC 1st-half net profit up 10.0 pct.</title>
<headline>UIC 1st-half net profit up 10.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    33.52  vs   30.36</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    2.5   vs    2.2</p>
<p>    Group shr fully diluted (cents)  2.2   vs    2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     163.91  vs  171.46</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    60.16  vs   57.17</p>
<p>    Investment income		    2.24  vs    6.65</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		   7.69  vs   11.96</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	   10.32  vs    7.73</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			65.03  vs   60.02</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.54  vs   12.22</p>
<p>    Minorities		  (loss)  17.98  vs   17.44 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Full name is United Industrial Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
